sequenceDiagram
    participant User as User / kubectl
    participant K8sAPI as Kubernetes API<br/>6443/TCP HTTPS
    participant Webhook as Webhook Server<br/>443/TCP TLS
    participant ISCtrl as InferenceService<br/>Controller
    participant LLMCtrl as LLMInferenceService<br/>Controller
    participant LMCtrl as LocalModel<br/>Controllers
    participant Knative as Knative Serving
    participant Istio as Istio<br/>VirtualService
    participant GW as Gateway API<br/>HTTPRoute
    participant KEDA as KEDA<br/>ScaledObject
    participant S3 as Object Storage<br/>S3/GCS/Azure
    participant Prometheus as Prometheus<br/>8443/TCP

    Note over User,Prometheus: InferenceService Creation Flow

    User->>K8sAPI: Create InferenceService CR
    K8sAPI->>Webhook: POST /mutate-serving-kserve-io-v1beta1-inferenceservice<br/>TLS, Kubernetes admission
    Webhook-->>K8sAPI: Mutated resource (defaults applied)
    K8sAPI->>Webhook: POST /validate-serving-kserve-io-v1beta1-inferenceservice<br/>TLS, Kubernetes admission
    Webhook-->>K8sAPI: Validation result

    K8sAPI->>ISCtrl: Watch event: InferenceService created
    ISCtrl->>K8sAPI: Get ServingRuntime / ClusterServingRuntime
    ISCtrl->>K8sAPI: Create Deployment (predictor pod)
    ISCtrl->>Knative: Create Knative Service (serverless)
    ISCtrl->>Istio: Create VirtualService (traffic routing)
    ISCtrl->>KEDA: Create ScaledObject (autoscaling)
    ISCtrl->>K8sAPI: Update InferenceService status

    Note over User,Prometheus: LLMInferenceService Creation Flow

    User->>K8sAPI: Create LLMInferenceService CR
    K8sAPI->>Webhook: POST /mutate-serving-kserve-io-v1alpha2-llminferenceservice<br/>TLS, Kubernetes admission
    Webhook-->>K8sAPI: Mutated resource
    K8sAPI->>Webhook: POST /validate-serving-kserve-io-v1alpha2-llminferenceservice<br/>TLS, Kubernetes admission
    Webhook-->>K8sAPI: Validation result

    K8sAPI->>LLMCtrl: Watch event: LLMInferenceService created
    LLMCtrl->>K8sAPI: Create Deployment, Service, Secret, ServiceAccount
    LLMCtrl->>GW: Create HTTPRoute (Gateway API routing)
    LLMCtrl->>KEDA: Create ScaledObject (autoscaling)
    LLMCtrl->>K8sAPI: Update LLMInferenceService status

    Note over User,Prometheus: LocalModel Caching Flow

    User->>K8sAPI: Create LocalModelCache CR
    K8sAPI->>Webhook: POST /validate-localmodelcaches<br/>TLS, Kubernetes admission
    Webhook-->>K8sAPI: Validation result
    K8sAPI->>LMCtrl: Watch event: LocalModelCache created
    LMCtrl->>K8sAPI: Create PersistentVolume
    LMCtrl->>K8sAPI: Create PersistentVolumeClaim
    LMCtrl->>K8sAPI: Create LocalModelNode resources
    LMCtrl->>K8sAPI: Create batch/v1 Job (model download)
    K8sAPI-->>S3: Job pulls model artifacts<br/>HTTPS, IAM/credentials

    Note over User,Prometheus: Metrics Collection

    Prometheus->>ISCtrl: Scrape metrics via kube-rbac-proxy<br/>8443/TCP HTTPS
    Note right of LLMCtrl: LLM controller uses<br/>controller-runtime authn/authz<br/>(HTTP/2 disabled for CVE mitigation)
    Prometheus->>LLMCtrl: Scrape metrics<br/>authn/authz protected
